      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should remove this check because we should make sure the broadcast is sent when a VPN connects. Instead we should make sure there is some non-null initial proxy to make sure connecting sends the broadcast with null.\n\nI think it should be possible to ensure this in a simple manner by calling Proxy.setHttpProxyConfiguration in l.912 with some custom-built ProxyInfo object which could just be a direct proxy to localhost with any port. We would reset it at the end.\nhuangaaron@, you have done some work in this space lately, do you think this would work in this context ? Or, do you have a better idea ?",
